    "teach_4": {
      "id": "teach_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Dividing by a decimal? Make the divisor whole first.\n\n3.6 ÷ 0.04\n\nShift both points two places right (× 100):\n\n360 ÷ 4 = 90\n\nBoth numbers moved together, so the answer stays fair.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_4_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_4_step": {
      "id": "teach_4_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Check by reversing: 90 × 0.04 = 3.60 ✓\n\nShifting only one number is the classic error — 3.6 ÷ 4 or 360 ÷ 0.04 both give wrong answers.\n\nSame shift for both. Always.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_4"
        }
      ]
    },
