    "teach_5_step": {
      "id": "teach_5_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now the division flips into a multiplication:\n\n21/4 ÷ 7/2\n= 21/4 × 2/7\n= (21 × 2)/(4 × 7)\n= 42/28 = 3/2 = 1.5\n\nWhen a decimal meets a fraction, converting the decimal usually wins.",
